@startuml 使用案例 2_4: 收容所送養管理
title 使用案例2.4: 收容所送養管理

actor "收容所會員" as User
participant "ShelterAnimals.vue" as ShelterAnimalsPage
participant "shelters.ts" as ShelterAPI
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "shelters.py(blueprint)" as ShelterBlueprint
participant "shelter_service.py" as ShelterService
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "shelter.py(model)" as ShelterModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 進入收容所動物管理頁面 ==
User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 訪問 /shelter/animals
activate ShelterAnimalsPage
ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: onMounted()
ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 從 authStore 取得 shelter_id
note right
  取得當前使用者的 primary_shelter_id
  檢查 role === 'SHELTER_MEMBER'
end note

== 2. 載入收容所動物列表 ==
ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAPI: getShelterAnimals(shelter_id, filters)
activate ShelterAPI
note right
  filters 包含:
  - status (狀態篩選)
  - species (物種: CAT/DOG)
  - sex (性別)
  - keyword (關鍵字搜尋)
  - vaccinated (是否接種疫苗)
end note
ShelterAPI -> ShelterBlueprint: GET /shelters/{shelter_id}/animals
activate ShelterBlueprint

ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: @jwt_required()\\n取得 current_user_id
ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterService: check_shelter_permission(user_id, shelter_id)
activate ShelterService
ShelterService -> UserModel: User.query.get(user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: 使用者資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ShelterService: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

ShelterService -> ShelterService: 檢查權限
note right
  檢查條件:
  - user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER 
    AND user.primary_shelter_id == shelter_id
  - OR user.role == ADMIN
end note

alt 權限不足
  ShelterService --> ShelterBlueprint: PermissionDeniedError
  ShelterBlueprint --> ShelterAPI: 403 Forbidden
  ShelterAPI --> ShelterAnimalsPage: 錯誤訊息
  ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: alert('無權限')
end
deactivate ShelterService

ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterModel: Shelter.query.filter_by(shelter_id, deleted_at=None).first()
activate ShelterModel
ShelterModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM shelters WHERE shelter_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> ShelterModel: 收容所資料
deactivate DB
ShelterModel --> ShelterBlueprint: Shelter 物件
deactivate ShelterModel

== 3. 查詢動物列表 (含篩選) ==
ShelterBlueprint -> AnimalModel: 建立查詢
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: query = Animal.query.filter(\\nshelter_id==?, deleted_at IS NULL)
note right
  基礎查詢:
  - shelter_id = :shelter_id
  - deleted_at IS NULL
end note

ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: 應用篩選條件

alt 有 status 篩選
  ShelterBlueprint -> AnimalModel: query.filter(status=?)
  AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: 加入 WHERE status=?
end

alt 有 species 篩選
  ShelterBlueprint -> AnimalModel: query.filter(species=?)
  AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: 加入 WHERE species IN (...)
end

alt 有 sex 篩選
  ShelterBlueprint -> AnimalModel: query.filter(sex=?)
  AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: 加入 WHERE sex=?
end

alt 有 keyword 搜尋
  ShelterBlueprint -> AnimalModel: query.filter(\\nname LIKE ? OR breed LIKE ? OR color LIKE ?)
  AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: 加入模糊搜尋條件
end

alt 有 vaccinated 篩選
  ShelterBlueprint -> AnimalModel: 子查詢 medical_records (疫苗記錄)
  AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: 加入 EXISTS 子查詢
end

AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals WHERE ... ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT ? OFFSET ?
activate DB
note right
  包含所有篩選條件和分頁
  支援查看草稿狀態 (管理用)
end note
DB --> AnimalModel: animals 列表
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> ShelterBlueprint: animals[]
deactivate AnimalModel

ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: 組裝回應 {animals, pagination}
ShelterBlueprint --> ShelterAPI: 200 OK + {animals[], pagination}
deactivate ShelterBlueprint
ShelterAPI --> ShelterAnimalsPage: {animals, pagination}
deactivate ShelterAPI
ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: 顯示動物列表 (含篩選和分頁)
deactivate ShelterAnimalsPage

== 4. 批次操作 - 批次更新狀態 ==
User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 選擇多隻動物
activate ShelterAnimalsPage
ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: selectedAnimals.push(animal_id)
note right
  使用者可以:
  - 點擊卡片空白區域選取
  - 勾選左上角選擇框
  - 使用全選功能
end note

User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 點擊「批次操作」→ 選擇操作類型
note right
  批次狀態更新操作類型:
  - draft: 變更為草稿 (SUBMITTED/PUBLISHED/RETIRED → DRAFT)
  - submit: 提交審核 (DRAFT → SUBMITTED)
  - publish: 發布上架 (SUBMITTED 或 DRAFT → PUBLISHED)
  - retire: 下架 (PUBLISHED → RETIRED)
  
  ⚠️ 刪除不在批次 API 中:
  前端逐一呼叫 deleteAnimal(id) 進行刪除
  僅 DRAFT 狀態可刪除
end note

ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAPI: batchUpdateAnimalStatus(shelter_id, {animal_ids, action})
activate ShelterAPI
ShelterAPI -> ShelterBlueprint: PATCH /shelters/{shelter_id}/animals/batch/status
activate ShelterBlueprint

ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterBlueprint: @jwt_required()\\n檢查權限
ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterService: check_shelter_permission(user_id, shelter_id)
activate ShelterService
ShelterService -> ShelterService: 驗證收容所會員權限
ShelterService --> ShelterBlueprint: 權限確認
deactivate ShelterService

ShelterBlueprint -> ShelterService: batch_update_animal_status(...)
activate ShelterService
note right
  參數:
  - shelter_id
  - user_id
  - animal_ids[]
  - action (draft/submit/publish/retire)
end note

ShelterService -> ShelterService: 驗證操作類型
ShelterService -> AnimalModel: 查詢所選動物
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\\nWHERE animal_id IN (...)\\nAND shelter_id = ?\\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animals[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> ShelterService: animals[]
deactivate AnimalModel

ShelterService -> ShelterService: 驗證動物是否屬於該收容所
alt 動物不存在或不屬於收容所
  ShelterService --> ShelterBlueprint: ValidationError
  ShelterBlueprint --> ShelterAPI: 400 Bad Request
  ShelterAPI --> ShelterAnimalsPage: 錯誤訊息
  ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: alert('操作失敗')
end

== 5. 執行批次狀態更新 ==
loop 每隻動物
  ShelterService -> ShelterService: 檢查當前狀態
  
  alt action == 'draft' AND status IN (SUBMITTED, PUBLISHED, RETIRED)
    ShelterService -> AnimalModel: animal.status = DRAFT
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals SET status='DRAFT', updated_at=NOW() WHERE animal_id=?
    activate DB
    note right
      允許從已提交/已發布/已下架
      變更回草稿狀態
    end note
    DB --> AnimalModel: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> ShelterService: success_count++
    deactivate AnimalModel
  else action == 'submit' AND status == DRAFT
    ShelterService -> AnimalModel: animal.status = SUBMITTED
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals SET status='SUBMITTED', updated_at=NOW() WHERE animal_id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalModel: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> ShelterService: success_count++
    deactivate AnimalModel
  else action == 'publish' AND status IN (SUBMITTED, DRAFT)
    ShelterService -> AnimalModel: animal.status = PUBLISHED
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals SET status='PUBLISHED', updated_at=NOW() WHERE animal_id=?
    activate DB
    note right
      ⚠️ 允許從 DRAFT 或 SUBMITTED 直接發布
      後端支援但前端 UI 只允許 SUBMITTED
    end note
    DB --> AnimalModel: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> ShelterService: success_count++
    deactivate AnimalModel
  else action == 'retire' AND status == PUBLISHED
    ShelterService -> AnimalModel: animal.status = RETIRED
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals SET status='RETIRED', updated_at=NOW() WHERE animal_id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalModel: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> ShelterService: success_count++
    deactivate AnimalModel
  else 狀態不符合
    ShelterService -> ShelterService: failed_count++\\nerrors.append(錯誤訊息)
  end
end

ShelterService -> AnimalModel: db.session.commit()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: 提交成功
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> ShelterService: 完成
deactivate AnimalModel

ShelterService -> ShelterService: 組裝結果
note right
  結果包含:
  - success_count: 成功數量
  - failed_count: 失敗數量
  - errors[]: 錯誤訊息列表
  - total: 總數
end note
ShelterService --> ShelterBlueprint: {success_count, failed_count, errors}
deactivate ShelterService

ShelterBlueprint --> ShelterAPI: 200 OK + 批次操作結果
deactivate ShelterBlueprint
ShelterAPI --> ShelterAnimalsPage: 操作結果
deactivate ShelterAPI

ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 顯示操作結果
ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: clearSelection()\\nloadAnimals() (重新載入)
ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: alert('✅ 成功更新 {count} 隻動物')
deactivate ShelterAnimalsPage

== 6. 替代流程 - 單隻動物編輯 ==
opt 使用者編輯單隻動物
  User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 點擊「編輯」按鈕
  activate ShelterAnimalsPage
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 檢查編輯權限
  note right
    權限檢查:
    - 草稿和已提交狀態可編輯
    - 已發布和已領養不可編輯基本資料
  end note
  
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: getAnimal(animal_id)
  activate AnimalAPI
  AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals/{animal_id}
  activate AnimalBlueprint
  AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: get_animal(animal_id)
  activate AnimalService
  AnimalService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.filter_by(animal_id).first()
  activate AnimalModel
  AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals WHERE animal_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL
  activate DB
  DB --> AnimalModel: 動物資料
  deactivate DB
  AnimalModel --> AnimalService: Animal 物件
  deactivate AnimalModel
  AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: Animal
  deactivate AnimalService
  AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 200 OK + animal
  deactivate AnimalBlueprint
  AnimalAPI --> ShelterAnimalsPage: animal 資料
  deactivate AnimalAPI
  
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 顯示編輯模態框\\n填充表單資料
  ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: 顯示編輯表單
  
  User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 修改資料並儲存
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: updateAnimal(animal_id, formData)
  activate AnimalAPI
  AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: PATCH /animals/{animal_id}
  activate AnimalBlueprint
  AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: update_animal(animal_id, user, data)
  activate AnimalService
  AnimalService -> AnimalModel: 更新 Animal 資料
  activate AnimalModel
  AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals SET name=?, breed=?, ... WHERE animal_id=?
  activate DB
  DB --> AnimalModel: 更新成功
  deactivate DB
  AnimalModel --> AnimalService: Animal 物件
  deactivate AnimalModel
  AnimalService -> AnimalModel: db.session.commit()
  activate AnimalModel
  AnimalModel -> DB: COMMIT
  activate DB
  DB --> AnimalModel: 提交成功
  deactivate DB
  AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 完成
  deactivate AnimalModel
  AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: Animal
  deactivate AnimalService
  AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 200 OK + animal
  deactivate AnimalBlueprint
  AnimalAPI --> ShelterAnimalsPage: 更新成功
  deactivate AnimalAPI
  
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 關閉模態框\\nloadAnimals() (重新載入)
  ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: alert('✅ 更新成功')
  deactivate ShelterAnimalsPage
end

== 7. 替代流程 - 篩選重置 ==
opt 使用者重置篩選
  User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 點擊「清除篩選」
  activate ShelterAnimalsPage
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: resetFilters()
  note right
    重置所有篩選條件:
    - status = ''
    - species = ''
    - sex = ''
    - keyword = ''
    - vaccinated = false
  end note
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: loadAnimals() (重新查詢)
  note right: 回到步驟 2 重新載入列表
  ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: 顯示所有動物
  deactivate ShelterAnimalsPage
end

== 8. 替代流程 - 導航到其他頁面 ==
opt 使用者導航
  User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 點擊「單次送養」
  activate ShelterAnimalsPage
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: router.push('/my-rehomes')
  ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: 導向個人送養頁面
  deactivate ShelterAnimalsPage
  
  User -> ShelterAnimalsPage: 點擊「返回收容所管理」
  activate ShelterAnimalsPage
  ShelterAnimalsPage -> ShelterAnimalsPage: router.push('/shelter/dashboard')
  ShelterAnimalsPage --> User: 導向收容所儀表板
  deactivate ShelterAnimalsPage
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 收容所動物列表已載入並顯示
  2. 支援多種篩選條件 (狀態、物種、性別、關鍵字、疫苗接種)
  3. 批次操作已完成並更新狀態
  4. 草稿狀態可編輯和刪除
  5. 所有操作都有權限檢查
  
  **批次操作規則:**
  - draft: SUBMITTED/PUBLISHED/RETIRED → DRAFT (變更為草稿)
  - submit: DRAFT → SUBMITTED (提交審核)
  - publish: SUBMITTED 或 DRAFT → PUBLISHED (發布上架)
  - retire: PUBLISHED → RETIRED (下架)
  - delete: 不在批次 API 中,前端逐一呼叫 deleteAnimal(),僅 DRAFT 可刪除
  
  **權限控制:**
  - 收容所會員僅能管理所屬收容所的動物
  - 管理員可管理所有收容所動物
  - 檢查 user.primary_shelter_id === shelter_id
  
  **查詢優化:**
  - 分頁查詢 (預設每頁 20 筆)
  - 多條件篩選支援
  - 模糊搜尋 (名稱、品種、顏色)
  - 子查詢支援 (疫苗記錄檢查)
  
  **使用者體驗:**
  - 多選支援 (點擊卡片、勾選框、全選)
  - 批次操作選單 (下拉選擇)
  - 即時顯示選取數量
  - 操作結果反饋 (成功/失敗統計)
end note

@enduml